# Cursor team (City Day)

Shared product rules, flow, and claiming live in `CLAUDE.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, and `docs/SDLC.md`. Do not restate them here.

## Cursor-only

- At session start, generate a team ID: `cursor-<4 hex chars>` (e.g. `echo cursor-$(openssl rand -hex 2)`). Put it in every status comment, summary, `Question for PM:`, and PR body.
- Roles live in `.cursor/agents/` (same names as `.claude/agents/`; Cursor prefers `.cursor/`).
- Only the Engineering Manager writes to GitHub (labels, assignees, status comments, questions, PR open/edit). Other roles return results to the EM.
- Leave `.claude/` and `CLAUDE.md` alone unless a ticket says otherwise.
- Claim tickets per [docs/SDLC.md#claiming-a-ticket](docs/SDLC.md#claiming-a-ticket).
